title: "reqifsharp-sage"
abstract: "Sage is the AI agent of the reqifsharp ecosystem: grounded knowledge of the OMG Requirements Interchange Format (ReqIF) 1.2 and the reqifsharp C# library, packaged as a Claude Code plugin with skills for metamodel and schema lookup, specification citation, API lookup and ReqIF file inspection."
